      "title": "Bull of the Day: Dollar General (DG)",
      "summary": "Dollar General (DG), a Zacks Rank #1 Strong Buy, has successfully rebuilt its business after struggling in 2023-2024. The company reported four consecutive quarters of earnings beats averaging 19.1% and raised full-year guidance. With same-store sales growth driven by increased customer traffic and expanding margins, DG shares have advanced 35% over the past year, supported by its unique retail footprint in underserved rural markets.",
